- **The curve.** With Position selected, open the **Graph Editor** (the graph icon above the timeline). The speed now rises and falls like a hill instead of jumping straight to one level.

This is how I did it: select both keys, then **Animation > Keyframe Assistant > Easy Ease**, or press **F9**.

